 @randomstuff can you confirm that there are no other similar requirements that this clashes with? 

If there is no clash and we want to include this requirement, I would suggest simplifying to:

"_Verify that when the application derives cryptographic keys derived from passwords or other information of lower cryptographic strength, it uses an approved password-based key derivation function with key stretching parameters set which balance security and performance to prevent a password brute-force attack compromising the resulting cryptographic key._"

@ingo-rauner let me know what you think about this proposal as well

